PLANK local patch for SDL 3.4.2: preserve posted pointer positions.

Keep upstream c39d772a07b57e841be4f46e81f72b4d3b6316a8's physical mouse
workaround, while allowing remotely posted absolute input in fullscreen.
No relative input, other platform, permission or event-routing policy changes.

--- a/src/video/cocoa/SDL_cocoawindow.m
+++ b/src/video/cocoa/SDL_cocoawindow.m
